--- !u!114 &114260034968042401
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1117878815064172}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1208
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 但你可没闲工夫观察自己的伤口，这魔气侵蚀的可不仅是你的身体，甚至连你的神魂都感觉像是要被一口一口撕咬而后吞噬。
